      "anchor": "Synthetic O7 exposes Relay use→Q→Relay replies→further Q without increased initial demand. Preserve four distinct correct initial tickets by minute 16: I1=10g/L, I2=24g/L, I3=25g/H, I4=40g/H; record actor burden. O1 supplies stipulations, not empirical confirmation.",
